            "review_title": "Review at Xôi Bát",
            "review_text": "Lo rider W\nLondon, United Kingdom63 contributions\n0\nAmazing value. Make sure you take a GRAB from the centre\nApr 2024 • Solo\nThis is on the Michelin guide as a great value place to eat so i gave it a go\n\nFirst this is in district 7 so you will need a GRAB taxi\n\nReally cheap so not a problem\n\nThe venue is just off the main road an is a cafe style, no more than 6 tables to seat a max of 15 people.\n\nI ordered the sticky rice with pork belly and cured pork.\n\nYou get a bowl of rice with some fried onion rings and garlic, a separate bowl of bork belly and some kin chi and some soup.\n\nThe flavours and pork are out of this world\nIts slow cooked and flavoursome.\nThe pork melts in the mouth and is wonderful. Its not greasy but as its the belly there will be some fat.\nThe flavours are a combination of sweet and salty.\nWonderful\nWith a coke it comes to less than 100,000dong\n\nIts brilliant. Give this a go\nRead more\nWritten April 27, 2024",
